# The APK is kept out of git AND out of the deployment.
#
# It is now 102 MB, past Vercel's 100 MB per-file limit, so it can no longer be
# deployed alongside the site at all. It lives in Vercel Blob instead and
# APK.url in lib/site.ts points there — which also means the GitHub integration
# is now safe to enable, since nothing about the download depends on the repo.
public/*.apk

